    "W.S. Gong is a writer and software developer in San Francisco. His fiction appears in The Rumpus and Fourteen Hills. He holds an MFA from San Francisco State University and is a fellow of the Virginia Center for the Creative Arts. He is an alumnus of Bread Loaf, Sewanee, Tin House, the Kenyon Review Writers Workshop, and the Napa Valley Writers’ Conference."
